7432437268820", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974479_767432440602153_5847822232720520044_n.png?_nc_cat=108&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=ktdJcSzDrVwQ7kNvwGWU6Na&_nc_oc=Adq85hezlCDPfdgbSfo1SqiSpXrjrmNgxHNMYftQrsBmiH1qjYvjCNMfwlFAA3Y_a_Q&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQT4kn0CqM2BQHNig5Rj4AU4AIE2rfqefMIsCDjowqgFzg&oe=6B006D23"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "videocover..png", "id": "4033990933345146", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974838_4033990936678479_3976172047705502593_n.png?_nc_cat=107&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=BuLFtkYUL08Q7kNvwGcaKWD&_nc_oc=Adp9YbnkrNu9XB3GZIBR9WhKUuDumjA1KthCVQEaqJNSyAnPhkidTC1lWwPGasbiUr4&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQRgMiD7i6xEQEmH9KP21YOBh-BdfWrk0zjRHdvXqSqaXQ&oe=6B0084CE"}, "display_name": "NAKA", "keywords": [], "long_description": "everis NAKA provides customers with eXtended Reality (XR) spaces for configuring immersive experiences to cover a wide variety of use cases:\n\nTraining spaces\nConfigurable focus-intensive trainings performed in safe, controlled 3d realistic models and environments \n\nShowroom and retail spaces\nEngaging and memorable experiences for retail and customer support processes\n\nProcesses and business support spaces\nBusiness-specific connected process for employees, associates and other collaborators (e.g. onboarding, support)\n\nMeetings and collaborative spaces\nMulti-user, VoIP-enabled environment for sharing documents, videos, tasks and much more.", "short_description": "The purpose of everis NAKA is to help top level organizations to provide large-scale engaging immersive experiences either to their customers or to their employees by providing an enterprise-level extended reality platform."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://www.everisnaka.com/priva